          "title": "Who this affects",
          "blocks": [
            { "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": "Everyone on the Northwind payroll, at every site in the UK and Ireland. If you're paid through an agency, your terms are set by your agency and this doesn't change them.",
              "sources": ["brief:audiences.A1", "brief:audiences.A4"] },
            { "kind": "paragraph", "content": "",
              "gap": true,
              "gap_note": "Whether agency-paid contractors see any change to payment timing is still unconfirmed — Procurement has not come back on the agency contracts. Do not publish the reassurance above until they do." }
