          "title": "What you need to do",
          "blocks": [
            { "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": "Activate your colleague portal account and check your bank details are correct, by 14 September. It takes about ten minutes. If your details are wrong on the first run, your pay will be delayed while we fix them.",
              "sources": ["brief:audiences.A1.required_action", "cc-go-live-email-example"] },
            { "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": "You don't need a work computer — the portal works on any phone, and there are kiosks in every site canteen.",
